(# Paperclip Gateway Integration Research Report) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Generated: 2026-05-07) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Executive Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Paperclip was evaluated as a Workforce Operations Layer for Mission Control Gateway. The) Tj
T*
(right role is task/company/workforce orchestration under Gateway policy, not command) Tj
T*
(authority. Agent Zero remains commander, Hermes remains lieutenant and skill/workflow) Tj
T*
(builder, Pi remains dispatcher candidate, SpaceAgent remains web research specialist,) Tj
T*
(OpenCloud remains a worker/runtime engine, and OpenClaw+ remains the runtime/skills/adapters) Tj
T*
(layer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Research result: Paperclip is a strong fit for workforce tracking, co-worker modeling,) Tj
T*
(issue/task records, heartbeat routines, budgets, and work-product storage. It should stay) Tj
T*
(sandboxed until its own test blockers, owner login, and Gateway write-adapter design are) Tj
T*
(closed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## What Paperclip Provides) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Company/workforce structure for agents and co-workers.) Tj
T*
(- Issue/task tracking that can map Gateway missions into work items.) Tj
T*
(- Work-product records for research packets, skill proposals, and final reports.) Tj
T*
(- Heartbeat/routine concepts for recurring status checks.) Tj
T*
(- Budget and cost governance concepts.) Tj
T*
(- Adapter/plugin extension points for local model/agent runtimes.) Tj
T*
(- UI for company, agents, tasks, issues, budgets, approvals, and work products.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Gateway Fit) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Paperclip should be represented as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Gateway node: paperclip.) Tj
T*
(- Type: workforce operations layer.) Tj
T*
(- Authority: subordinate to Gateway and Agent Zero.) Tj
T*
(- Access mode: read-only until sandbox health, owner auth, and Bridge Session write adapters) Tj
T*
(are proven.) Tj
T*
(- Write behavior: blocked unless Bridge Session scope and a registered Paperclip adapter) Tj
T*
(explicitly allow it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Role Matrix) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Owner: final authority.) Tj
T*
(- Gateway: routing, policy, registry, documentation, memory, and audit hub.) Tj
T*
(- Agent Zero: commander and final decision-maker.) Tj
T*
(- Hermes: lieutenant and skill/workflow builder.) Tj
T*
(- Pi: dispatcher candidate and route optimizer in shadow mode.) Tj
T*
(- SpaceAgent: browser/web/YouTube/Firecrawl research specialist.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip: workforce/company/task orchestration layer.) Tj
T*
(- OpenCloud: worker/runtime and future agent-creation support layer.) Tj
T*
(- OpenClaw+: runtime, skills, adapters, reports, and governance layer.) Tj
T*
(- Existing agents: retained specialist workforce.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Integration Model) Tj
T*
ET
