() Tj
T*
(Gateway request flow:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Owner request enters Gateway.) Tj
T*
(2. Gateway classifies the route.) Tj
T*
(3. Pi can recommend workforce routing in shadow mode.) Tj
T*
(4. Agent Zero approves the mission and remains accountable.) Tj
T*
(5. Paperclip records or tracks the task only when write adapter and Bridge Session allow it.) Tj
T*
(6. Worker or specialist returns work product.) Tj
T*
(7. Gateway validates the result.) Tj
T*
(8. Agent Zero reports to the owner.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Paperclip Data Objects To Map) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Gateway mission to Paperclip issue.) Tj
T*
(- Owner command to Paperclip issue.) Tj
T*
(- Mini-agent task to Paperclip issue.) Tj
T*
(- SpaceAgent Research Packet to Paperclip work product.) Tj
T*
(- Hermes skill proposal to issue/work product.) Tj
T*
(- Pi dispatcher recommendation to issue comment.) Tj
T*
(- Agent Zero decision to issue approval.) Tj
T*
(- Bridge Session to governance event.) Tj
T*
(- Completed task to final report.) Tj
T*
(- Blocked task to exact blocker.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Security Model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Paperclip must not expose public UI routes.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip must not receive raw secrets, auth files, or inline tokens.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip writes require Bridge Session and registered adapter.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip co-workers must have supervisor, purpose, scope, budget, memory TTL, allowed) Tj
T*
(tools, forbidden tools, expiration condition, and audit trail.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip cannot replace Agent Zero, Hermes, Pi, SpaceAgent, OpenCloud, OpenClaw+, or) Tj
T*
(existing agents.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip cannot use raw root shell, Docker socket, direct secret reads, Zapier writes,) Tj
T*
(HeyGen generation, SMB mount, or broad connector execution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Research Findings) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Sandbox install/build/typecheck previously passed.) Tj
T*
(- Paperclip test suite had Tailnet environment expectation failures in its own repo.) Tj
T*
(- Loopback and Tailnet sandbox access were previously proven when the sandbox server was) Tj
T*
(intentionally running.) Tj
T*
(- Owner login is not fully proven.) Tj
T*
(- Current live service is inactive, so health/UI are blocked until Paperclip is started) Tj
T*
(again in sandbox mode.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Recommended Implementation Phases) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Keep Paperclip sandbox-only while its own Tailnet test blocker is addressed or formally) Tj
T*
(waived.) Tj
T*
(2. Prove health and owner login over Tailnet.) Tj
T*
(3. Keep Gateway node and bridge routes read-only.) Tj
T*
(4. Add write adapter only after Bridge Session scope and audit design are complete.) Tj
T*
ET
